6f566857720fa2d8e4f4865cf7da8a3049fddc74c97c18b3d2479f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"365fae996cf6a9ab540ca1bf1b40247537330ef05e43b402fde47b944ce2258d","logical_entry_identity":"eeceddbc295f2bb250666e093821c886a72c944b56c480c5855cfee09cc3a076","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Alchemists can bind gems to armour to grant them magical effects, to protect the wearer or improve their powers. Some commercial alchemists can imbue gems into jewellery.","source_tag":"init.lua load_tips","target":"炼金术士可以把宝石镶嵌到盔甲上，赋予其魔法效果，以保护穿戴者或增强其能力。一些提供商业服务的炼金术士还能把宝石镶嵌到首饰中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7fff83498855785e8a7472fbc221a8415e5e7d798592da6003c314d77ae7cf9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3b23f69cadd4a1d40d5cff5b4e9fe31e835f9e712e90a0bce8de10989dbf9ba3","logical_entry_identity":"a2648111ac93d01e1f52fc53d8e75e8d3e5c660fffcfdc898f829e3f8e7d553f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"replaced by a time clone (and no one ever knew the difference)","source_tag":"_t","target":"被一个时间克隆体取代（其他人均不会感到任何差别）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d1122124bb9b66763147385a697f09b5f2e583ecebe5fd5998af34f9bb6483b2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4e2374c2ecea271139ec1bf5a87ed745a70e1169f5dc4b23bacb9f9201cbe194","logical_entry_identity":"9ff504284042d95c14dc09284c2311035cd25b3ba6158311ad044399cd9d01cc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"sneakthief","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"窃贼"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"61e2edc10288f4c27687b8fc9d2a582a5dfb67590995e041fc5bee2d4f9be7ab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"581d855c69e1d43b24262c5d72b48480e56f6b2b567d054f69c0cf5ba8c35914","logical_entry_identity":"6453eb246e2928f38c2559851e70e217955d5bc53b59bb0c881d69c04235a975","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Deploy a noisy lure that attracts all creatures within radius %d to it for %d turns.\n\t\tIt has %d life (based on your Cunning) and is very durable, with %d armor and %d%% resistance to non-physical damage.\n\t\tAt level 5, when the lure is destroyed, it will trigger some traps in a radius of 2 around it (check individual trap descriptions to see if they are triggered).\n\t\tUse of this talent will not break stealth.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"抛出一个诱饵来吸引 %d 码半径内的所有生物，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t诱饵有 %d 生命（基于灵巧），且非常坚韧，拥有 %d 护甲和 %d%% 非物理伤害抗性。\n\t\t在等级 5 时，当诱饵被摧毁时，它会触发其周围 2 码范围内的部分陷阱（请查看各陷阱自身的说明，以确认其是否会被触发）。\n\t\t此技能不会打断潜行状态。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca08f8d6cecb60ccd734b81574acaabc860cd1144b5e31af7ea767ec4c81d7bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6eb77aaf0f1b222746a709d0c77ffc851c67e8d29f9867a709e1f878ab01344c","logical_entry_identity":"bfba223da1b4b5f3319353e4d2fe1e55c00429199b0c406d1162e4e6a59d0925","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A complementing item would be your crowning glory.","source_tag":"_t","target":"再补齐一件配套的套装部件，将成为你至高无上的荣耀。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"189c348aaba253b61a66cacfccc5d7bddbee32abd2c243d42337ba08807b7633","component":"engine","entry_revision_identity":"98a1d5ba3dd78e38a3ca596a4260adecdd3c67b771908f6c4a4a4f43e497d8fe","logical_entry_identity":"5d80684dd3f32bf165f620ab3f9767ebd090b10e21c407b103c06f511ce2f75b","normalized_path":"engine.lua","source":"Green-skinned and ugly, this massive humanoid glares at you, clenching wart-covered green fists.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只绿皮丑陋的庞大人形生物正盯着你，同时它握紧了满是疣的绿色拳头。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e2e2e6e527176a09556896aaac0ca49382af3eebf21901b76ef5fc3e5517ba6b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a362646896c4da7978bc1abfa4d860585a7e2cc3fae65aad5321b56f33e67305","logical_entry_identity":"f882602be8b143881343a9a27486d65a80d231be947a8e313fc2954ee9b53b67","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"We preserve the past to protect the future. The hands of time are guarded by the arms of war.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们守护过去，以护佑未来。时间之手由战争之臂守卫。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"546487162a775e7d80a7d4f4f8ee6fcc53cdbb622fdf07965dcc4da8f119da4a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b0132b8b5a63b231d2b2d5e9da98b1f841754abc466741c614e7b082d310cf3c","logical_entry_identity":"cac2d0cbdb6fe24dda4f4a5ee94ba11c4b9eeabe188629d8da011d320d007f01","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#Relle, Cornac Fighter and Expedition Leader#{normal}#\nIt knows we're here.  Xann's gone, and I have to assume the worst.  Too late to run.  One option left, a contraption Sodelost ensured us he'd be able to use to get the kill...  shame he didn't leave instructions behind with it, it's unclear how to arm it, and I don't want to add \"being frozen solid\" to my list of troubles today.\nI might not know a great deal about artifice, but I know how wild animals work, and for all the praise they get, dragons are no better.  I don't need to know how to rig this device so it goes off when the beast steps on it - I just need to put it inside something it'll eat whole...\n#{italic}#Judging from this note's intact state and delicate placement next to a sack covered in assorted animal viscera, the dragon not only avoided setting off the trap, but has kept it as a trophy.  Inside the sack is a disarmed trap featuring a few recognizable alchemical flasks, and a means of mixing them in the right proportion when a pressure plate is triggered to produce a blast of ice. Figuring out how to arm it is almost as easy as figuring out how to make more traps like it.#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#探险队队长，科纳克人战士瑞丽#{normal}#\n那条龙知道我们在这里。希安失踪了，我只能作最坏的打算。逃跑已经太迟。只剩一个选择：苏达罗斯特向我们保证，他能用这套装置杀死那条龙……可惜他没把说明留在装置旁边，没人知道该如何启动它，而我可不想让今天的麻烦清单再多出“被彻底冻住”这一项。\n我或许不太懂机关术，却知道野兽会怎么做。龙尽管备受赞颂，在这一点上也不比其他野兽高明。我无需知道怎样把装置设成野兽踩中时触发——只须将它放进某种会被一口吞下的东西里……\n#{italic}#从纸条完好无损的状态，以及它被小心摆放在一个沾满各种动物内脏的袋子旁边来看，那条龙不仅没有触发陷阱，还把它当作战利品收藏了起来。袋中有一个已解除的陷阱，装有几只尚能辨认的炼金药瓶；压力板触发时，机关会按正确比例混合其中的药剂，爆发出寒冰。弄清如何启动它，几乎与弄清如何制作更多同类陷阱一样简单。#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"61d4df8c7d9909ae6505e3cb5b8ffb1032605d4fccea26fef49c4fbbead4b037","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b0ede62de2ac50c59363fa5ebf1166ba81971918c045e0f20de4a26cce86038f","logical_entry_identity":"8776a3e3a66b560e28fc73e84160217e7436b113538b83dae7b5f76e46fc9e5a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Prodigies: %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"觉醒技：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"593626716d1a82a0a4c728312721153f38dbdf6235211db961ee6b2f43f37bbb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b0ef730334a36d2f72a72a1d6735704feda38fa058fe5884ef658f3224cda987","logical_entry_identity":"5284e4daf2ddddb7b40de3d1e8c61fc086f39746a04c6c1a5ae41c34c62be3d4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An orc dressed in putrid robes. He mumbles in a harsh tongue.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个穿着腐烂长袍的兽人。他用刺耳的语言喃喃自语。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2ad6d4541da0a51560e6dc97e9dd1e797af8fd96bf881393304249863c2502a0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b0f05f6f81715255924367212b5045ad9749485e5b90e1c31f288ad4753b9452","logical_entry_identity":"ec66063480d4074a2f6708e34ccecd4632e5a5e87217395726b984a35a397cbe","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You pause time around you long enough to fire a single shot, doing %d%% damage.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Paradox and the cooldown will go down with more talent points invested.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你暂停时间给你足够的空闲射出一支箭，造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t伤害受紊乱值影响，按比例加成，另外技能等级提高可以降低冷却时间。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"88dc909694ebf3191df8c61e6952ad0e87068b48af6669654f03e89f6ae37476","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b0f5366ce2e43c4ec8988f45a83edaaae8a80f2ded0367c1311228c26e33568b","logical_entry_identity":"7b1a24a77ada8b107f88128645f915d799ab2d00ae02134003f875fc37fc853c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"flame coated sandals","source_tag":"_t","target":"一双被火焰覆盖的草鞋"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b4f0811124909059802785cb414e0bde5ba0b62c366232c7a3e21453bc5262cd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b0fa0933a1c35dd55046cb4b5c55034d0da268fa57a98a4f0fd7f4e57d439a6b",